  "body": "In [step 4.2.2](https://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#dom-cookiestoremanager-subscribe), the spec requests to resolve url with: \r\n\r\n> Let url be the result of [parsing](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-basic-url-parser) entry[\"[url](https://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#dom-cookiestoregetoptions-url)\"] with settings’s [API base URL](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#api-base-url).\r\n\r\nThis means when `entry[\"url\"]` is not present, we will use settings's url.\r\n\r\nHowever the existing [wpt test](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/e13ef7418666f26b30f17199f0b3c8f2a8ec8f6f/cookie-store/cookieStore_subscribe_arguments.https.any.js#L38) verifies service worker registration scope url is used when client does not specify url in option.\r\n\r\nWhat is the expected behavior? @inexorabletash @ayuishii \r\n",
